<title>UK: Credit local sets 100 mln euro 6-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit local sets 100 mln euro 6-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BIL and CCB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CRDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN EURO  COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    02.JUL.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES	SPREAD AT FULL FEES IS 11 BP OVER THE 2003 OAT.</p>
<p>		ALL MONETARY RIGHTS AND OBLIGATIONS IN RESPECT OF</p>
<p>THE NOTES SHALL BE DEEMED IN ECU AT THE RATE OF ONE ECU FOR ONE EURO.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
